eIds":[710890208]},{"nodeId":710890208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2616,"speakerName":"瑾武","textMapHash":3800980602,"text":"彼女の地図がなければ、その後の調査は極めて困難だっただろう…でも、私は彼女を気遣うばかりで、彼女の努力や苦労に目を向けてあげられなかった…","nextNodeIds":[710890209]},{"nodeId":710890209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2616,"speakerName":"瑾武","textMapHash":2874029594,"text":"彼女はあたしたち鉱夫とは端から違っていた。なぜそこに気付かなかったのだろう…","nextNodeIds":[710890210]},{"nodeId":710890210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":837054626,"text":"彼女はただ、忘れられたくないだけ。","nextNodeIds":[710890211]},{"nodeId":710890211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2616,"speakerName":"瑾武","textMapHash":2910788978,"text":"神のご高配を受けていないあたしら一般人はみんなそんな感じよ…","nextNodeIds":[710890212]},{"nodeId":710890212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2616,"speakerName":"瑾武","textMapHash":1737010962,"text":"…それでも、彼女ほどの執着を持つ人はいなかった。","nextNodeIds":[710890213]},{"nodeId":710890213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2616,"speakerName":"瑾武","textMapHash":3533257570,"text":"しかし、あたしは夢見ることをあきらめた…平凡な毎日に慣れきってしまっている自分に気づくと…","nextNodeIds":[710890214]},{"nodeId":710890214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2616,"speakerName":"瑾武","textMapHash":812083154,"text":"志璇のような若者にあれこれ言う権利はもうない気がする…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7108902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7108901,7108902],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC"